  "description": "However, our customers expect more from us, they expect that we think ahead. We have done this and found out things that at first, we simply could not believe. During the two years of experimentation with new and uncompromising geometry, we found that the GeoMetron shape, balance and rider space can make both beginners and professionals alike faster.\n\nAll “G” models have been completely redesigned including a new swingarm and BOOST dropouts which are lighter and stiffer. Likewise, the suspension response has been fine tuned with the use of quadruple sealed ball bearings. Sealed for the applause of the people taking the ION-G16 on wet and muddy winter rides. The proven NICOLAI shock lever has been pushed through many FEM strength calculations in order to reduce the weight while keeping the same rigidity. Although our 5-axis CNC machine now runs a little longer, as a reward it’s lighter.",
